{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1f5d709d16c30ee82ede71ec2795f5e814b355665032d09976ce6d66768a4f8c", "ja": "突然劇場に現れた黒井社長は、大イベント\n『アイメガ』に765プロを招待する。\nなんと玲音と詩花がデュオを組んで出演\nするそう。対して765プロからは響と翼が\n出演する事に。戦いの火蓋は切られた！", "zh": "突然出现在剧场的黑井社长，要邀请765制作人参加大型活动《爱梅嘉》。\n听说玲音和诗花会组成二人组合登台演出。另一方面，765制作人这边则由响和翼出演。\n战斗的帷幕拉开了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2cafbe416e4032473ab19bf27aa3af8697784ef90209296c89fb6e788aa69666", "ja": "（『アイメガ』に出場することになったものの……\nさて、誰に出てもらおうかな？　うーん……）", "zh": "（虽然决定要参加『偶像大赛』了……那么，该让谁出场呢？嗯……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1001_202xxx", "source_sha256": "8539806491d1d9562dfafe5bcd2bae7774784631159f742bd1457086a691aa13", "ja": "やあ、お邪魔するよ！", "zh": "嗨，打扰啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1002_201xxx", "source_sha256": "2787d5621e8616ddce57bfadadde725b2f8b41b91f676abdce7643c6f7a8f392", "ja": "グリュース・ゴット！　お疲れさまです、\n{$P$}さん。来ちゃいました♪", "zh": "您好！辛苦了，{$P$}先生。我来啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "681d856821e35c384b5c06905d6ad8d5c73cca823ebd37660eb54a3eb8595c6a", "ja": "あれ？　玲音に詩花じゃないか。今日は二人とも\n公演の予定はないと思うけど……どうしたんだ？", "zh": "哎？这不是玲音和诗花吗。我记得今天你们两位\n都没有演出的安排才对……怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1004_202xxx", "source_sha256": "2fedbddd4c6560a6579d90361e3d1cd06a9f4ccc78f1c28aa23aa7a53bbfed12", "ja": "もちろん、キミ達の様子を見に来たんだ。\n『アイメガ』に出場することになったんでしょ？", "zh": "当然是来看你们的情况啊。\n听说你们要参加《偶像大师百万现场》了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1005_201xxx", "source_sha256": "d493f8a125b1af10be59beb1f13e4439f29ad1671c78821ec19b9bdc1e7b3e67", "ja": "お話を受けていただけて、私たちもうれしいです。\nとっても励みになります！", "zh": "您愿意接受邀请，我们也很高兴。\n这对我们来说是莫大的鼓励！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5c641de29b617467a1e02e303384cea6a22e76918b3ec6f2d2b720a3e77f79a7", "ja": "励みに？　ということは、やっぱり……。", "zh": "成为动力？这么说，果然……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1007_202xxx", "source_sha256": "1185a7497d9284da8004da79e8eedfd2e04cc52064558ff86b6dd7dd12f269e6", "ja": "うん、もちろんアタシと詩花も、\n『アイメガ』に出る！", "zh": "嗯，当然啦，我和诗花也会参加《爱美嘉》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1008_201xxx", "source_sha256": "9bbbe5a1a8ff877d53f72937219a2637a3a49ab4146b045f8a44826473da5bb0", "ja": "はい、お姉さまと私で、その……\nデュオを組んで。", "zh": "是的，姐姐和我……组成双人组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a85829459af6e58801e1e6a65fd606b5a76af9e200b42dfba75f01ce4420e286", "ja": "なるほど、そうだと思っ……\nえっ？　玲音と詩花が……デュオを組んで！？", "zh": "原来如此，我就觉得是……诶？玲音和诗花……要组成双人组合！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1010_201xxx", "source_sha256": "9cc6e47cc6c1ba42bc670264125e18df0c1dd0b9c178b183bbc9d33588f30260", "ja": "そ、そうなんです。私にとっても、すごい挑戦で。\nお姉さまと並んで歌うなんて……。", "zh": "是、是这样的。对我来说也是一项巨大的挑战。\n竟然能和姐姐并肩歌唱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1011_201xxx", "source_sha256": "e037cddadfe7c35b9c2f9f2b47616e7d290ba0fd9ff049702ab3eb511e30a9ed", "ja": "今はまだ、不安でいっぱいです。\nでも……何かが見つかるかもっていう期待もあって。", "zh": "现在我还是充满了不安。\n不过……也期待着或许能找到些什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1012_202xxx", "source_sha256": "aa23639717c931776bf0926813a422444bf1d138b46bc2ee34cb2d4aabbdd094", "ja": "フフッ、何か見つけたいのはアタシもだけど。\nでも、楽しみにしてるよ、詩花！", "zh": "呵呵，我也想找到点什么。\n不过，我很期待哦，诗花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1013_201xxx", "source_sha256": "c4eabc9836f33837b3aa8d49111f0f52fed4cadbddd79a2150c8010b0e435a5d", "ja": "もう！　お姉さまったら。\n他人事だと思って……。", "zh": "真是的！姐姐真是的。\n就觉得事不关己……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1014_202xxx", "source_sha256": "b39a5059b99dbb1a9ea181dc160afa3457eaa22899771650ea04bdc2fee752a6", "ja": "ま、そういうわけで今度の『アイメガ』は、\nアタシ達デュオのデビューイベントになる。", "zh": "嘛，总之，这次的《爱美歌》就是我们双人组合的出道活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1015_202xxx", "source_sha256": "31cbf10743610c6356bb318d167f78987187392ac3070f67f655bd89da5c6ffd", "ja": "それで、思ったんだ。アタシ達とキミ達、\nどちらが会場を盛り上げられるか……？", "zh": "所以我就想啊，我们和你们，究竟哪边能让会场更热闹……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1016_202xxx", "source_sha256": "3ad34ee6c407f2e1ba01f30cc464ed6edace3df38dd989dbe486762332304beb", "ja": "そんな趣向も、たまにはいいんじゃないかってね！\nそれで765プロも誘うよう、黒井社長に頼んだんだ。", "zh": "我就想着，偶尔来点这样的安排也不错嘛！所以还拜托了黑井社长邀请765制作人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "3c7fdf209fd18bafb2ba3c603627b8e73776d631629ac1a8b2426d8a1ed7ab1e", "ja": "なるほど。そもそも玲音の発案だったのか……\nありがたいけど、どうしてまた？", "zh": "原来如此。说到底，这是玲音的提议啊……\n虽然很感谢，可为什么又要这样做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1018_202xxx", "source_sha256": "767e61900eb3df455c06813d62bd89504bc4f6804d0813fbaa7d3ae03608a8e1", "ja": "決まってるじゃないか。アタシが見たいからだよ！\n……キミ達の、本当の本気をね。", "zh": "这不是明摆着的吗？因为我想亲眼看看啊！\n……看看你们真正拼尽全力的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "44422be6dd77bf4faa2a627d181ec010f5fbb399d3524ea478d18e203ba3afca", "ja": "玲音……。", "zh": "玲音……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1020_202xxx", "source_sha256": "7c6420b1e6230905c2c5149715d645bc7d1d173f6fc9218f93d339d0e70ea72c", "ja": "それで、人選は終わった？\n誰がアタシ達の相手をしてくれるの？", "zh": "那么，人选已经决定好了吗？\n谁来做我们的对手？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "7b078a4f6f0657e459876cac4a154572f7a15eca2fa1ca812328e41ef2b539ad", "ja": "それをいま考えてたんだ。でも、相手が君たちとなると\nますます悩ましいというか……。", "zh": "我刚才就在考虑这个。不过，要是对手是你们的话，就更让人伤脑筋了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "c3a7ec3f1ab4b2e3b58fdac7d36468233c9f657bdc761e9b0bbf7113da8c628e", "ja": "（こうなると、パフォーマンスだけじゃない。\n物怖じしない、勢いや突進力をもった誰か……）", "zh": "（这样一来，重要的就不只是表演了。\n还需要一个无所畏惧、充满冲劲和突进力的人……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1023_013hib", "source_sha256": "22792e62a1e5bd394ae161c36516aeae4aa53b3da0436d64a95e92828da6f68d", "ja": "{$P$}、ここにいたんだね！\n翼とのレッスン終わったから……ああっ！？", "zh": "{$P$}，原来你在这里啊！\n因为和翼的训练结束了……啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e9faffcb5b085516ed740b4b709e88be28b59b7b1606fd33ab476c2df6fbe7f6", "ja": "わぁ、玲音さんと詩花さんだ～♪\n今日はもしかして、遊びに来てくれたんですか～？", "zh": "哇，是玲音小姐和诗花小姐～♪\n今天难道是来玩的吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1025_201xxx", "source_sha256": "dfe883b91e1bbd19b3252539eb4212d8903d6f80bbbf3b7d639b0ae4283a63e9", "ja": "響ちゃん、翼ちゃん！　グリュース・ゴット♪\n今日はちょっと、お仕事のお話で。", "zh": "响、翼！你好呀♪\n今天是来谈点工作的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1026_016tsu", "source_sha256": "cf862fd9aa060d5f128bce7bce79a041dc2ac3030caf50371c3e6ec4ebd5bb20", "ja": "お仕事？　劇場での公演じゃなくて？", "zh": "工作？不是剧场公演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1027_202xxx", "source_sha256": "c37fca25b7dcbf0934370f46dab21b6f43c8e7e354adbb4e96cd3d53f574c74c", "ja": "やあ、我那覇は久しぶりかな？　アタシが\nアメリカに行く前のフェスで会って以来だよね？", "zh": "嗨，我和我那霸算好久不见了吧？\n是自从我去美国前的音乐节见过面以来的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1028_013hib", "source_sha256": "4f73e075f5275232189e6faf2e43357836676eb9d289e7374812f67f2644aa06", "ja": "そ、そうだぞ。でも、よく覚えてたね？\n自分は劇場での公演も観せてもらったけど……。", "zh": "对、对啊。不过你居然还记得这么清楚？我也去剧场看过演出来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1029_202xxx", "source_sha256": "3192e792945d48b8f6b6bbd4e51775ae7a76bb7eb68c0ce704ee065ec64c1d8a", "ja": "あの時からキミは面白かったからね。でも、そうか。\n我那覇と伊吹……。うん！　相手にとって不足はない！", "zh": "从那时起你就很有趣了呢。不过，这样啊。\n我那霸和伊吹……嗯！正合我意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "549cb60ba92b8f603c0eda4963d5ade04b6392361739e8552411f86b5b214771", "ja": "（あっ）", "zh": "（啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1031_202xxx", "source_sha256": "c456787d5306b83d80145a7d267fae2e18987e6570ac0afb061fca3cef14180c", "ja": "ねえ、我那覇、伊吹！　二人でデュオを組んで、\n『アイメガ』に出てみない？", "zh": "喂，我那霸、伊吹！要不要两个人组成双人组合，参加《爱美歌》？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1032_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ee81e0f4526596df1e9ef3b087cc48b9523552b8837d4bf41fd8312910b4240e", "ja": "『アイメガ』？\nTVで毎年やってる『アイメガ』ですか？", "zh": "『爱豆大狂欢』？\n是电视上每年都在播的那个『爱豆大狂欢』吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1033_013hib", "source_sha256": "27a2725652b7a7bf41628e180068b39c899ce16d39aac929834b0cb82dbe8ee3", "ja": "え？　{$P$}、\n自分達、『アイメガ』に出ていいの！？", "zh": "咦？{$P$}，\n我们真的可以参加《爱巨星》吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1034_p", "source_sha256": "be6a271a1fa90344aeccd93edb93a73bbaa13f80169ba2b8ab784f49c7d9703a", "ja": "うーん、出ていいというか……\n今まさに、出ることになりそうというか……。", "zh": "嗯——与其说是可以参加……不如说，现在好像就要参加了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1035_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f3d5fb6ca823d089719d08fc9e9fe756be76a8eb930abdf19e36629d5bc2bc57", "ja": "はいは～い！　わたし、出ます出まーす！\n有名な人もいっぱい来ますよね？　楽しみ～♪", "zh": "好嘞好嘞！我要参加，我要参加啦！\n也会有很多名人来对吧？好期待～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1036_013hib", "source_sha256": "e60d3334faf56b07dafebf7e9e9e396bc9713a9f7a75964ec7aff8afd6a1788b", "ja": "あっ、ズルいぞ翼！　{$P$}、\n自分も！　自分も出るからね！　ね、いいでしょ？", "zh": "啊，太狡猾了，翼！{$P$}，我也要！我也要出演！好不好嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1037_201xxx", "source_sha256": "e56abdd8d5662eaf9d7b23597ce3679051071e0878a1335afdd1b8c6995a62fa", "ja": "すみません、{$P$}さん。\nまたお姉さまが、勝手なことを言って……。", "zh": "对不起，{$P$}先生。姐姐她又自顾自地说些任性的话了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1038_201xxx", "source_sha256": "992b0604836d1ea9a1e52aabb06bec3bee7772ea56c9e5bce951facccf199d36", "ja": "あ、でも、響ちゃんと翼ちゃんが出てくれるなら、\n私も、とってもうれしいです！", "zh": "啊，不过，如果响和翼能来出演的话，我也会特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1039_013hib", "source_sha256": "1ff73f63d30679704d0a8740ba60ae2b37559fdf57e8b9f67019a25dc185f867", "ja": "え？　詩花と玲音も出るの？\n……あっ、そっか！　これは挑戦状ってことだね！？", "zh": "诶？诗花和玲音也要参加吗？\n……啊，对了！这是挑战书的意思吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1040_016tsu", "source_sha256": "948b91fd9a85561eee7aff139f28f756ad458a5cc8cbdd0510244cd0d1a6e373", "ja": "ええっ！？　そうだったんですか～？", "zh": "诶诶！？原来是这样的吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1041_202xxx", "source_sha256": "0eadf362c43072031d29493e82605c4f7d8c4a41c4c02f0de11cea534b1e1b44", "ja": "そうだったんだ♪　どう、二人とも？　アタシと詩花と\n『アイメガ』の大舞台で、真っ向勝負してみない？", "zh": "原来是这样♪怎么样，你们两个？要不要和我、诗花一起，在『アイメガ』的大舞台上来一场正面较量？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1042_013hib", "source_sha256": "3dac0cfa122acb3e34dd6e8cb27a9cc0a931d64dd50197dc597ae8962a0eba38", "ja": "……もちろん、受けて立つぞ！　\n自分と翼なら、誰が相手でもなんくるないさー！", "zh": "……当然，放马过来吧！\n我和翼的话，不管对手是谁都总会有办法的啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1043_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d716a02618eb808896af2d06193842fbecb89bfd9ab2130a27639744fdebc455", "ja": "えっと……じゃあ、わたしも！\n誰が相手でも、なんくるないでーす！", "zh": "那个……那我也来！\n不管对手是谁，都没问题啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1044_202xxx", "source_sha256": "ba7ea59338b747c6307e1f2549d358b66b8a33bb3ba53b5b4053aa0273c505b7", "ja": "あははっ、いいね、決まりだ！\n……ね、{$P$}もいいよね？", "zh": "啊哈哈，不错嘛，那就这么定了！\n……呐，{$P$}也没意见吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1045_p", "source_sha256": "518000d1578017c87a48b1f8571a5dccee5dc4f8d22ef7955a07ce8fa512c5f6", "ja": "……やれやれ。まあ、異論はないよ。\n響、翼、二人で『アイメガ』に出場だ！", "zh": "……真拿你们没办法。不过，我也没有异议。\n响、翼，就由你们两个人去参加“偶像巨星”吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1046_013hib", "source_sha256": "a1dcce6181bc4361bba53ae530b25f6fdca9e942e79a293f4dd3d82db0f78486", "ja": "やった（ぞ）～！", "zh": "太棒啦（喽）～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1047_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0b7060cdf077616b32082b042ef971cbc690e4c5ca264b9bb784f4dc85d4cdbf", "ja": "やった～！", "zh": "太好了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1048_013hib", "source_sha256": "b8ab75b59c07b6a12dd586590d6dc73f8b5b67d031fe2453cbb2a4ce0e447e39", "ja": "翼、そうと決まったら早速レッスンしなきゃ！\n自分、先に戻ってるから！", "zh": "翼，既然决定了就得马上开始训练！\n我先回去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1049_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6b058d94ae40678fef42a8002c698a703eca2e1630cbe18c1c82c6d7eab82bd7", "ja": "ええ～っ！　今終わったところなのに～！？\n……あ、いっちゃった。もう、響さん、待って～！", "zh": "诶诶～！明明才刚结束～！？\n……啊，走掉了。真是的，响姐，等等我～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1050_p", "source_sha256": "0d739ae4b68d7990de5778afaf498d28281a239c77c75a5241eeda88d6785546", "ja": "……ありがとう玲音。\nあの二人に、いい機会をくれて。", "zh": "……谢谢你，玲音。\n给了她们两个一个好机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1051_202xxx", "source_sha256": "f2fec0e30af91a8abe1c58d6c3a992e4525845ad19062dbbc708617c2ed9c522", "ja": "気にしないでいいよ。これは別に、彼女達のために\nしていることじゃない。もっと純粋な……。", "zh": "不用在意。这并不是为了她们\n才做的事。而是更加纯粹的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1052_202xxx", "source_sha256": "d5bad0626e744056cd0c8f8a70bf77b63654a6588d72a990e3abe921e92f3b37", "ja": "ただの、アタシの趣味だ！\n……それじゃあね♪", "zh": "只是我的兴趣罢了！\n……那就先这样啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1053_201xxx", "source_sha256": "94f65db1d204945dbae658dfc1d53f1f03a3a42f51ffcba9fc745abad2a398d4", "ja": "……あっ、私には、とってもためになりますっ。\nよろしくお願いしますね！", "zh": "……啊，对我来说真的非常有帮助。\n请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_01_1054_p", "source_sha256": "6fcf1b8b2c9ffd0b6c713e99a59fc1215cea86c5c5a3bc3058ccfad2ce8b0bda", "ja": "（玲音と詩花のデュオとの共演か。どう転ぶか、先が\n見えないけど……とんでもない舞台にはなりそうだ！）", "zh": "（要和玲音、诗花这对组合同台演出吗？虽然不知道会如何发展，前景也难以预料……但肯定会成为一场不得了的演出！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
